WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
None of us lose

2
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:06,810
Lao Yang, the phone rang. I didn’t hear it.

3
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:16,210
All the coffee that the handsome guy left yesterday has been sold out

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,610
Now many people are urging us to hurry up and stock the goods.

5
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,490
All sold

6
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:29,220
If you have something to say, just say it. Don't stand there and hold it in.

7
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:32,240
Brother, I just feel a little free.

8
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,640
You give me such a high salary

9
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,240
I'll be here all day long with the air conditioner on and looking at the store.

10
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,240
Feels like eating free rice

11
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,640
Just starting now

12
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,240
In a few days, you will be so busy that your feet won’t even touch the ground.
